title: vcvt.f64.f32 of a signalling NaN is the default NaN; of a denormal, a signed zero
ref: A8.8 VCVT (between double-precision and single-precision) T1; A2.7 FPSingleToDouble(): FPUnpack() flushes the denormal (FZ), a NaN with DN = 1 is FPDefaultNaN() (FPSCR = 0x03000000 on iOS (DN, FZ, round to nearest; ADR 0022))

[code]
b7eec01a    vcvt.f64.f32 d1, s0
b7eee02a    vcvt.f64.f32 d2, s1
7047        bx lr

[in]
s0 = 0x7F800001
s1 = 0x80000001

[out]
d1 = 0x7FF8000000000000
d2 = 0x8000000000000000
